==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The only real threat on this stage is the early Sinner Snaches, as their surges can potentially destroy your attackers. Once these are disposed of, the stage essentially transforms into an early SOL stage.

